### **Checklist of Core Reminders**

* 🚽 **Toilet Break** – every 90–120 min (less distraction if paired with stretch)
* 💧 **Drink Water** – every 30–60 min (with visual cue like filling bottle animation)
* 🍎 **Snack Time** – every 2–3 hrs (protein + slow carbs = longer focus)
* 🏃 **Walk & Fresh Air** – every 2–4 hrs (sunlight = dopamine boost)
* 🧘 **Micro Reset** – every 45–60 min (stretch, breathe, shake out hands)
* 😌 **Eye Relax** – every 20 min (look 20ft away for 20s — 20/20/20 rule)

